<Stub
  title="Indoor Pickleball in Boise, ID | Bodies in Motion"
  description="Indoor pickleball at Bodies in Motion in Boise, Idaho. All skill levels welcome. Book your court time online."
  path="/pickleball"
  h1="Indoor Pickleball at Bodies in Motion"
  eyebrow="Where fun meets family"
>
  <p>
    Bodies in Motion has an indoor pickleball court where parents can enjoy friendly matches while the kids explore our
    indoor playground. All skill levels are welcome, and our Flatbread Cafe is there for a break between games. Pickleball
    costs $12 per individual or $10 per person for groups of 2–5; private groups of 6–12 people are $9 per person.
    Monthly memberships are $59 per month.
  </p>
  <!-- TODO(Duncan): the old Pickleball page's own schedule differs from the Hours page (e.g. weekday slots vs 9 am-3 pm / 5:30-7 pm). Hours below follow the Hours page; confirm. -->
  <p>
    Pickleball hours: Monday–Thursday 9:00 am–3 pm and 5:30 pm–7 pm, Friday 9:00 am–6:00 pm, Saturday and Sunday
    9:30 am–1 pm. Monday through Friday times are by appointment only and must be booked online. Saturday and Sunday
    court times are first come first serve and cannot be reserved in advance.
  </p>
